WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
What sort of a mindset would less siege to 8 million people with 900,000 troops?

00:07.000 --> 00:15.000
Women, children, sick people, locked in as animals of what I know of England.

00:15.000 --> 00:21.000
If 8 million animals were locked in, the RSPCA would have made a lot of noise about it.

00:22.000 --> 00:24.000
These are human beings.

00:27.000 --> 00:29.000
What is going to happen

00:30.000 --> 00:33.000
when the curfew is lifted will be a bloodbath?

00:34.000 --> 00:35.000
The people will come out.

00:35.000 --> 00:37.000
There are 900,000 troops there.

00:37.000 --> 00:40.000
These 900,000 troops. What are they going to do?

00:40.000 --> 00:42.000
When they come out?

00:43.000 --> 00:44.000
There will be a bloodbath.

00:44.000 --> 00:47.000
Mr. President, has anyone thought

00:49.000 --> 00:51.000
that what happens when there is a bloodbath?

00:52.000 --> 00:53.000
And we will fight.

00:54.000 --> 00:55.000
And when...

00:56.000 --> 00:57.000
And when...

01:01.000 --> 01:02.000
And when...

01:03.000 --> 01:07.000
And when a nuclear armed country fights to the end,

01:07.000 --> 01:11.000
it will have consequences far beyond the borders.

01:12.000 --> 01:16.000
It will have consequences for the world, which is why I repeat, I'm here.

01:17.000 --> 01:19.000
Because I'm mourning you, it's not a threat.

01:20.000 --> 01:23.000
It's a fair worry that where are we headed?

01:24.000 --> 01:27.000
And I've come here to tell the UN, you've got to.

01:27.000 --> 01:29.000
This is a test for the United Nations.

01:30.000 --> 01:34.000
You are the one who guaranteed the people of Kashmir the right of self-determination.

01:36.000 --> 01:38.000
This is the time to take action.

01:38.000 --> 01:45.000
And number one action must be that India must lift this inhuman curfew,

01:45.000 --> 01:47.000
which has lasted for 55 days.

01:49.000 --> 01:53.000
The world community must give the people of Kashmir the right of self-determination.

01:53.000 --> 01:54.000
Thank you.
